    // Specification:
    // Requires that the lengths of `a` and `b` are either equal or one of them is 1
    // so that broadcasting is possible without ambiguity.
    //
    // Ensures that the returned vectors both have the same length equal to max_len,
    // where max_len = max(a.len(), b.len()).
    //
    // Ensures that:
    // - each returned vector is either a clone of the original vector (if it had length max_len),
